{"title":"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> represent digits. If  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e038ac6d7b55bdbff7c3c73326eecdcb61254cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}{ccc}&amp;A&amp;B\\\\ +&amp;C&amp;A\\\\ \\hline &amp;D&amp;A\\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"100\" height=\"63\" />and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/9/239389e56191fe562b2cd80bde3386d1906797db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}{ccc}&amp;A&amp;B\\\\ -&amp;C&amp;A\\\\ \\hline &amp;&amp;A\\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"92\" height=\"63\" />,what digit does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> represent?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a97af68b0e27ddcc9bb656fba006759ed49696f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 8\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fde3a90470d37b38f0b1b46f9f471ffdfb3fddc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B+A=A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"88\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\nNext, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/9/0a91cd55475aecf65c80c5ac14795c1eabbdc5fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B-A=A\\implies0-A=A,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"224\" height=\"16\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d72c739bd8c2b60ef756afaf71e48afd30a74938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=5$\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> as the \"0\" mentioned above is actually 10 in this case. \n</p><p>Now we can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/0/360c13c8bf47be7c920c262d75d93ce9faf865cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}{ccc}&amp;A&amp;0\\\\ +&amp;C&amp;A\\\\ \\hline &amp;D&amp;A\\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"100\" height=\"63\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55c8f67eec13439aeba55245e0dec1887cb147aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{tabular}{ccc}&amp;5&amp;0\\\\ +&amp;C&amp;5\\\\ \\hline &amp;D&amp;5\\end{tabular}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"94\" height=\"52\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a532312c9fc20694547ba3142499d5beeda07e40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D=5+C.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Finally, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/6/4760032d24317eaaade749de39117ca6e103f021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A-1-C=0\\implies{A=C+1}\\implies{C=4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"345\" height=\"14\" />, So we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96b3ce69288902c88b13bf8a4a61c2cb50a19375.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D=5+C\\implies{D=5+4}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 9 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"293\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bfswsEB-kJU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bfswsEB-kJU</a> \n--WhyMath\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 8\">2009 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/ind